From 7cb28c682e417418538f628143bf983d903e6a24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Backschat <mbackschat@mail.de>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 09:54:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(core): preserve buffered queries across run eviction

Transfer the remaining same-run buffer without changing query supersession groups. A pending history fetch may let a later task produce the replacement run activation, which must be retained.
---
